Frame":"12 months"},{"measure":"Fatigue at initiation of treatment with pegcetacoplan and every 6 months until end of follow-up","description":"Patient reported outcome scale scores for the Functional assessment of chronic illness therapy (FACIT) - Fatigue. It is a 13-item scale and each item is scored on a 5-point Likert Scale ranging from \"0-Not at all\" to \"4-Very much\". The FACIT-fatigue score is obtained by summing all item scores. The score range from 0 to 52, higher score indicating less fatigue and lower score indicating more fatigue.","timeFrame":"18 months"},{"measure":"Fatigue at initiation of treatment with pegcetacoplan and every 6 months until end of follow-up","description":"Patient reported outcome scale scores for the Functional assessment of chronic illness therapy (FACIT) - Fatigue. It is a 13-item scale and each item is scored on a 5-point Likert Scale ranging from \"0-Not at all\" to \"4-Very much\". The FACIT-fatigue score is obtained by summing all item scores. The score range from 0 to 52, higher score indicating less fatigue and lower score indicating more fatigue.","timeFrame":"24 months"},{"measure":"Fatigue at initiation of treatment with pegcetacoplan and every 6 months until end of follow-up","description":"Patient reported outcome scale scores for the Functional assessment of chronic illness therapy (FACIT) - Fatigue. It is a 13-item scale and each item is scored on a 5-point Likert Scale ranging from \"0-Not at all\" to \"4-Very much\". The FACIT-fatigue score is obtained by summing all item scores. The score range from 0 to 52, higher score indicating less fatigue and lower score indicating more fatigue.","timeFrame":"30 months"},{"measure":"Fatigue at initiation of treatment with pegcetacoplan and every 6 months until end of follow-up","description":"Patient reported outcome scale scores for the Functional assessment of chronic illness therapy (FACIT) - Fatigue. It is a 13-item scale and each item is scored on a 5-point Likert Sc