acoplan at enrollment. Decision to initiate treatment shall be made by the treating physician and independently from the decision to include the patient in the study.\n* Patient is willing and able to provide written informed consent to participate in the study in a manner approved by the Institutional Review Board/Independent Ethics Committee and local regulations.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Enrollment in a concurrent clinical interventional study, or intake of an Investigational Medicinal Product (IMP), within three months prior to the start of the current pegcetacoplan treatment.\n* Initiated current treatment with pegcetacoplan in an interventional study.","healthyVolunteers":false,"sex":"ALL","minimumAge":"18 Years","stdAges":["ADULT","OLDER_ADULT"],"studyPopulation":"Adult patients (≥18 years) with PNH, who started routine treatment with pegcetacoplan up to 12 months prior to enrollmentor at enrollment","samplingMethod":"NON_PROBABILITY_SAMPLE"},"contactsLocationsModule":{"overallOfficials":[{"name":"Clinical Program Lead +46 08-697-20 00","affiliation":"Swedish Orphan Biovitrum","role":"STUDY_DIRECTOR"}],"locations":[{"facility":"Liverpool Hospital","city":"Liverpool","state":"New South Wales","country":"Australia","geoPoint":{"lat":-33.91938,"lon":150.92588}},{"facility":"Calvary Mater Newcastle","city":"Waratah","state":"New South Wales","country":"Australia","geoPoint":{"lat":-32.90667,"lon":151.72647}},{"facility":"Sunshine Coast University Hospital","city":"Birtinya","state":"Queensland","country":"Australia","geoPoint":{"lat":-26.74322,"lon":153.11913}},{"facility":"Canberra Hospital","city":"Garran","zip":"2605","country":"Australia","geoPoint":{"lat":-35.34206,"lon":149.10846}},{"facility":"Institut Jules Bordet","city":"Anderlecht","country":"Belgium","geoPoint":{"lat":50.83619,"lon":4.31454}},{"facility":"AZ Sint-Jan","city":"Bruges","country":"Belgium","geoPoint":{"lat":51.20892,"lon":3.22424}},{"facility":"CHU Brugmann-Site Horta","city":"Brussel